-3. **Round 4+:** Use lair actions (if applicable) — rockfall, poison cloud
-4. **If bloodied (50% HP):** Attempt to flee OR offer negotiation
-5. **If cornered:** Fight to the death (Frightful Presence to scatter weak PCs)
